<title>USA: Royal buys Lead America for 488,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Royal buys Lead America for 488,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MORRISTOWN, N.J. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royal Millennia Group Ltd said Monday it bought Lead America Inc for 488,000 shares.</p>
<p>The Morristown-based insurance distribution firm said the purchase could result in net pre-tax earnings of $1.00 per share over 12 months from the purchase.</p>
<p>Royal will operate under the name Lead America and no longer be known as Royal Millennia Group Limited.</p>
</text>
